    2. Pick blue position near one corner/edge (row 0-2 or H-3..H-1, col 0-3 or W-4..W-1)
    3. Pick red position in a different quadrant, also near an edge
    4. Ensure row_dist in [7,12], col_dist in [3,10], row_dist != col_dist
    5. Verify chebyshev_dist >= 9 and path stays within grid bounds
    6. Return black grid with blue and red pixels placed
```
